{title: Kya Janoo Sajan}
{artist: Kavita Krishnamurthy Lata Mangeshkar R D Burman}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]Kya jaanu [E]sajan hoti [G]hai kya [C]gham ki shaam
[C]Jal uthe [E]sau diye [F]jab liya [Am]tera naam
[Am]Kya jaanu sajan
[Am]jab se [C]milee najar mathe [F]peh ban gaye
[F]bindiya [G]nayan tere [E]dekho sajna
[Am]dhar lee [C]jo pyar [F]se meree kalaiya
[F]piya teree [G]ungliya ho [E]gayee kangna
[Am]Kaanton mein [C]main khadi, nainon [F]ke dwaar pe
[F]Nis din [G]bahaar ke [E]dekhoon sapne
[Am]chehere ki [C]dhool kya, [F]chanda ki chaandini
[F]utri to [G]reh gayi [E]mukh pe apne
